## Selector Strategy

1. `getByRole('button', { name: '...' })`
2. `getByTestId('data-testid-value')`
3. `getByLabel('label text')`
4. `getByText('visible text')`

**ห้ามใช้**: CSS class (`.btn-primary`), XPath (`//button`)

