## Agentic Pipeline Commands

```bash
# Full pipeline: requirement → TCM → Playwright → Word
python scripts/orchestrator.py --input "requirement.md"

# Figma input
python scripts/orchestrator.py --figma-image "screen.png"

# TCM only (ไม่รัน Playwright)
python scripts/orchestrator.py --input "requirement.md" --skip-playwright

# Inject screenshots อย่างเดียว
python scripts/screenshot_injector.py

# Dry-run
python scripts/screenshot_injector.py --dry-run
```

